    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Create a flowchart to model your own scenario.\r\n\r\n2. Save your flowchart to your **Backpack**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Shopping Cart\r\n\r\n- If the user adds at least one item, display the notification badge with the current item total.\r\n- If the user has no items in their cart, hide the badge.\r\n",
